    "created_at": "2016-03-11T15:21:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-11T15:21:13Z",
    "body": "I think ideally when you assign a `blob` URL it's associated object is cloned directly. Otherwise you can assign it somewhere else, and then it's a matter of knowing which one does something first. I think that's non-determinism.\n",
