    "updated_at": "2016-03-11T19:19:48Z",
    "body": "Maybe hard to understand, but still deterministic as long as the spec defines when the URLs are resolved, right? Resolving eagerly everywhere sounds like quite a hassle, resolved URLs would need to be stored all over the place just in cast they're later needed.\n",
