    "created_at": "2016-03-12T11:23:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-12T11:23:22Z",
    "body": "One has to resolve before starting the fetch, so I'm not sure how to spec eager (or lazy) URL resolving in a way that would have this problem. But I'll try to PR this (eventually) and we can see if there are in fact race conditions before or after the change.\n",
